# Files apify push leaves out of the upload. None of them is read by the image (see .dockerignore).
# docs/ stays in: it keeps the upload above the CLI's 3 MB cut-off, so the CLI sends one archive. Below
# it the CLI sends inline files, and with the art's base64 overhead the API refuses them (sourceFilesTooLarge).
proof
scripts
eval
scenarios
review
submission
